# Multi-Tenancy & RLS

Every table definition in the Drizzle schema must include `tenantId: uuid('tenant_id').notNull()`.
Every RLS policy must reference `current_setting('app.tenant_id')::uuid`.
The `setTenantContext()` function in `src/database/tenant-context.ts` must be called before every query.

Never hand-write `WHERE tenant_id = ?` — RLS handles isolation automatically.
Never disable RLS in migration files except inside an explicit `admin_bypass` policy definition.
